    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88621" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαν-έχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wait</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕως . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.19.12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.94.3
			</span></i>: c. acc., <i>await</i>, 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν καιρὸν τῆς ἐντεύξεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.103.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rely on, place one's dependence on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίσι</span>”
