			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				10.6.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BJ</u>
				4.2.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i>(?) in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMed.Lond.</u>
				155.4.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς βοηθείαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.84.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>devote oneself to</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῷ, τοῖς
